{"text":"\n            "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"In Frankfurt a. M. and many congregations neither "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"בריך שמה"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" nor "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"שמע ישראל"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" is said, but the reader begins with "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"גדלו"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"end":"t:note"}
