{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n174.jpg","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"After the reading, the Torah scroll is lifted up and rolled together again. When the Torah scroll is being lifted up, one says:"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"j:transclude","attrs":{"type":"external","target":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/torah/vezot_hatorah@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-marmorstein-1965-en"}}
