{"text":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n182.jpg"}}
{"text":"After the Haphtora the Shofar is blown."}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"type":"optional-page-reference"}}
{"text":" But when the first day of the festival falls on a Sabbath, then one continues immediately with "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"יקום פורקן"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" (p. "}
{"start":"t:ref","attrs":{"type":"page","target":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:yequm_purqan/scholars@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-marmorstein-1965-en"}}
{"end":"t:ref"}
{"tail":")"}
